  "description": "ADVANCED CARBON CONSTRUCTION\n\nThe SL1 frame uses Toray T400 Carbon and HCIM (Hollow Core Internal Molding) technology, exclusive to BH’s high-end road frames.\n\nFULL CARBON ENDURANCE FORK\n\nDesigned to improve aerodynamics and vibration absorption, the fork allows greater clearance between the wheel and fork, optimizing airflow.\n\nREAR TRIANGLE AND OPTIMIZED LATERAL STIFFNESS\n\nThe compact stay rear improves responsiveness and power transmission.\n\nThe bottom bracket, with the BB386EVO system, increases the diameter of the lower diagonal tubes up to 80 mm, reducing tube thickness and improving torsional and rear stiffness.\n\nEASY-TO-USE QUICK LEVERS\n\n12 mm Thru Axle closures, hidden and tool-free.\n\nUDH UNIVERSAL\n\nCompatibility with UDH derailleur hanger.\n\nTYRE CLEARANCE UP TO 32 MM - AND UP TO 35 MM ON SOME MODELS\n\nMore safety, grip, and comfort on long rides.",
